{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05773","headline":"送赵都护赴安西 · 卢象","name":"送赵都护赴安西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下客候旌麾，元戎复在斯。\n门开都护府，兵动羽林儿。\n黠虏多翻覆，谋臣有别离。\n智同天所授，恩共日相随。\n汉使开宾幕，胡笳送酒巵。\n风霜迎马首，雨雪事鱼丽。\n上策应无战，深情属载驰。\n不应行万里，明主寄安危。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}